.TH AVR\-ORG\-INSTALL\-RUNNER 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-install-runner \- Manage GitLab runners, one per Linux machine type.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org install runner
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage GitLab runners, one per Linux machine type.
.PP
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
create
Create group runners in GitLab and configure their machine types in Avrea.
.TP
delete
Remove MACHINE_TYPE's runner configuration from Avrea.
.TP
list
List all machine types, runner status, and exact GitLab setup instructions.
.TP
set
Verify and configure MACHINE_TYPE, replacing its previous runner if present.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-install (1),
.BR avr-org-install-add (1),
.BR avr-org-install-list (1),
.BR avr-org-install-remove (1),
.BR avr-org-install-rotate (1),
.BR avr-org-install-set-selection (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner-create (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner-delete (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner-list (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner-set (1)
